hook-redactor src/patterns.rs: azure_cred_guid_matches_tenant_id.
Go keeps the separator; Rust rewrites it to '='.
-- input --
TenantId: 11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555 trailing
-- must_contain --
<redacted:api_key>
-- must_not_contain --
11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555
-- want --
TenantId: <redacted:api_key> trailing
-- deviation --
prefix
